Subject: sunxi: H713: delay V2 panel power until HDMI timing is latched

Keep the V2 panel supply off and reset held during LVDS setup and the
MIPS launch. Wait for the HDMI source transition, latch 720p again and
verify the panel is still off before running the existing power-on
sequence. Enable the lamp after panel power-up.

Three HDMI-connected warm FEL trials showed the boot logo, including
one started by Linux shutdown and two by U-Boot teardown. Normal warm
reboot qualification remains pending.

